    <title lang="fr">Journeys in Africa</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Kilwa Kisiwani: Swahili King Of the Indian Ocean</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">This ancient ruined city, lost to history, was one of the most powerful in the world during its prime. The architectural sophistication and sheer size will amaze. Then Journeys heads out to the deep ocean for some big game fishing. Will we land the big one or return empty handed?</desc>
