<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261002132500 +0000" stop="20261002135500 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">Journeys in Africa</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Victoria Falls: The Smoke That Thunders</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">One of the 7 Natural Wonders of the World, Victoria Falls is an amazing spectacle that straddles the Zambia/Zimbabwe border. The force of the water is so intense that the water bouncing back creates a rainforest. Remarkably, the wildlife in the area is as abundant as the water going over the falls.</desc>
