<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261003154000 +0000" stop="20261003160500 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">The Antonov Dream</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Tiger Sharks in the Bahamas + Crystal Cave of Abaco, Bahamas</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">In the series pilot, host Jonathan Bird travels to the Bahamas, where diver interactions with Tiger sharks have become up close and personal. These large and dangerous animals are not only being hand-fed, but actually handled by divers. Jonathan learns how to flip a Tiger shark from experienced shark handlers. Next, Jonathan investigates the Crystal Cave of Abaco, Bahamas…considered the most highly-ornamented underwater cave in the world!</desc>
    <category lang="fr">Documentaire</category>
