<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261002043752 +0000" stop="20261002050734 +0000">
    <title>Ocean Vet S1 - "Eagle Rays"</title>
    <desc>Teaming up with international scientist Dr Matt Ajemian and eagle ray wrangler Chris Flook the team face a tricky task to capture one of the most intelligent fish in the ocean in some of Bermudas most beautiful surroundings.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261002050734 +0000" stop="20261002053715 +0000">
    <title>Ocean Vet S1 - "Tiger Taggers"</title>
    <desc>Follow the team as they struggle to catch and tag the biggest tiger shark they’ve ever encountered as they complete their mission to help study, save and protect this incredible shark species.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261002053715 +0000" stop="20261002060000 +0000">
    <title>Wildlife Heroes S1 - "Jonathan Franzen"</title>
    <desc>Jonathan Franzen, the bestselling author and enthusiastic birdwatcher not only familiarizes us with the birdlife, but also discusses the far-reaching consequences of the drastic decline in birds on a global scale and what we can do to save them.</desc>
  </programme>
  
